2026-08-15T15:38:00.4972525Z [trace] agentic_outcome: planned Final("Generated the agentic-recipe mermaid diagrams, split into 5 parts, from the planner's own recipe table — a visual overview of how Formal AI drives its own tools.\n\nGenerated document (agentic-recipes.md):\n\n# Formal AI agentic recipes (generated)\n\n<!-- Generated by the Formal AI Agent CLI (`formal-ai agent`) from the planner's own\n     recipe table (src/agentic_coding/diagram.rs). Do not hand-edit; regenerate. -->\n\nA high-level, split-into-parts visual overview of how Formal AI drives its own agentic\nCLI to complete a task. Part 1 shows how a request is routed to a recipe; each later part\ndetails what happens for input handled by that recipe — the deterministic\n`search -> fetch -> write -> verify -> final` state machine in `src/agentic_coding/`.\n\nScope: these diagrams cover the issue #468/#538 recipe slice. The planner also routes\nself-heal, dreaming-audit, source-graph, ledger, explain, change-request, repair-strategy,\nrebuild, Google-Trends learning/catalog, question-catalog, and the general capability\nrouter — the `otherwise` edge in Part 1 stands for all of them.\n\n## Part 1 — Overview: how a task is routed\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart TD\n    user[\"user task\"] --> router{\"plan_chat_step<br/>routes by keywords\"}\n    router -->|\"formaliz / knowledge base / fisherman\"| formalize[\"Formalize a text into a knowledge base (#468)\"]\n    router -->|\"more detailed / grammatical number / a known concept\"| meaning[\"Make a meaning more detailed (#538)\"]\n    router -->|\"mermaid / diagram / visual overview\"| diagram[\"Generate these diagrams (#538)\"]\n    router -->|\"cst/ast / abstract-syntax / reason about itself\"| self_ast[\"Store the CST/AST of the meta algorithm (#538)\"]\n    router -->|\"otherwise\"| solver[\"ordinary solver text\"]\n```\n\n## Part 2 — Recipe: Formalize a text into a knowledge base (#468)\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    formalize_task[\"user task<br/>(formaliz / knowledge base / fisherman)\"]\n    formalize_task --> formalize_0[\"1. web_search<br/>find the source text\"]\n    formalize_0 --> formalize_1[\"2. web_fetch<br/>read it; a tool error falls back to the canonical synopsis\"]\n    formalize_1 --> formalize_2[\"3. write_file<br/>formalize prose into Links Notation\"]\n    formalize_2 --> formalize_3[\"4. run_command<br/>cat the file to verify the write landed\"]\n    formalize_3 --> formalize_final([\"final answer<br/>the artifact inline\"])\n```\n\n## Part 3 — Recipe: Make a meaning more detailed (#538)\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    meaning_task[\"user task<br/>(more detailed / grammatical number / a known concept)\"]\n    meaning_task --> meaning_0[\"1. web_search<br/>find the concept's Wikidata lexemes\"]\n    meaning_0 --> meaning_1[\"2. web_fetch<br/>read the forms; recover the missing plural\"]\n    meaning_1 --> meaning_2[\"3. write_file<br/>re-derive the grounded block, byte-for-byte the seed\"]\n    meaning_2 --> meaning_3[\"4. run_command<br/>cat the block to verify\"]\n    meaning_3 --> meaning_final([\"final answer<br/>the artifact inline\"])\n```\n\n## Part 4 — Recipe: Generate these diagrams (#538)\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    diagram_task[\"user task<br/>(mermaid / diagram / visual overview)\"]\n    diagram_task --> diagram_0[\"1. write_file<br/>render the mermaid parts from the recipe table\"]\n    diagram_0 --> diagram_1[\"2. run_command<br/>cat the document to verify\"]\n    diagram_1 --> diagram_final([\"final answer<br/>the artifact inline\"])\n```\n\n## Part 5 — Recipe: Store the CST/AST of the meta algorithm (#538)\n\n```mermaid\nflowchart LR\n    self_ast_task[\"user task<br/>(cst/ast / abstract-syntax / reason about itself)\"]\n    self_ast_task --> self_ast_0[\"1. write_file<br/>parse the planner via meta-language; write the AST node census\"]\n    self_ast_0 --> self_ast_1[\"2. run_command<br/>cat the census to verify\"]\n    self_ast_1 --> self_ast_final([\"final answer<br/>the artifact inline\"])\n```")
